# Cloudflare routing (Workers static assets). The site is built for
# /Portfolio/ (its GitHub Pages path, which the CMS also bakes into image
# URLs), so the Cloudflare bundle keeps it in that folder and the bare domain
# forwards to it.
#
# Every route is a real pre-rendered file (scripts/prerender.mjs), so no
# rewrites are needed — and none should be added for /Portfolio/*: Cloudflare
# applies these rules even when a file matches, so they'd shadow those pages.
